        <p>LONDON MISSIONARY • SOCIETY. ANNIVERSARY OF WARRINGTON AND DISTRICT AUXILIARY. TO-NIGHT (SATURDAY), NOV. 15th, at 7.30. AT WYCLIFFE CONGREGATIONAL CHURCH MEMORIAL BUILDINGS. WELCOME MEETING to the DEPUTATION. To be addressed by Rev. ARTHUR N. JOHNSON, M.A. • (Home Secretary), Rev. W. W. STEPHENSON (Gooty, S. India). The chair will be taken by Mr. J. LONGLAND. TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), NOVEMBER 16th, The Rev. A. N. JOHNSON, ILA., will preach— Morning, 10.45: Elmwood Avenue Congregational Church. Evening, 6.30: Wycliffe Congregational Church. The Rev. W. W. STEPHENSON will preach— Morning, 10.30: Runcorn Congregational Church. Evening, 6.30: Widnes Congregational Church. MONDAY, NOVEMBER 17th. 7.30: Public Meeting, Runcorn, Rev. W. W. STEPHENSON. 8.0: Public Meeting Widnes, Rev. A. N. JOHNSON, M.A. Collections at ,all Services and Meetings for the funds of the London Missionary Society.</p>
