        <p>Now showing the Latest Designs in Artistic and Inexpensive BARLESS FIRE. GRATES, COOKING RANGES, WOOD CHIMNEY PIECES, TILED PANELS and HEARTHS. Sole District Agent for the 'HERALD' Kitchen Ranges &amp; PEVERIL' Fire Grates.</p>
