      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-11-15_WidnesExaminer_art0066" n="art0066">
        <head>EXAMINER, SATITRDAYI NOVEMBER 15, 1913.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATITRDAYI NOVEMBER 15, 1913.</p>
        <p>I</p>
        <p>I</p>
        <p>I' ,i 1</p>
        <p>CHURCH AND THE 'TRADE'</p>
        <p>Rev. H. Ogden and the Rector's .` Brewery " Speech.</p>
        <p>•I'llillit .' ii.';llll'iiiliglitifFlo 01 mill '',' 'ilimil fill.' l'irl., :',.7,''',"1.',-,.i' 1111' I ! If till .I i• .‘,.; f' i 511 , tillirill!ili,ilmolillui-• 11-„ , ..' ' ' I 'i , , i H? , ' ' i . .. 11. 0 .- 'it' . „ , , ~ I, • :.4 ..: .',l .: , I - /SI i r 1 lir : .1., .il 11111, ill- ii, ..E..,1 .. , . ~,, . hi, Ili' L 11,1 .-..-ii 1 .:..,11, 1111 i!, ....,:. , , ..--iii Iri ~ -- loll' Roil -iiplc - i 1 1,1 ''' ' B '--STY • ii ii . .0 ..s. .1 1 11 ....1ik...4 _ . • Ili, .1, .1, , 111 . ~_ 1.; .. 1 1 i .:., ., . oii",l . , . , ,1 , i 111111,11111111iiillivoi1 liliiiii I, , „ii , - , • , , 1 , , , , 1 .1 :11 •'iv,H, "i' ' it '.y fir 7,0 „ I, !.. " i 1 .: ; •.i. ~ ii. . ' i ~ ~1 „go ) 41111 intill • , 1.1 t. lit .." ', 1 ' , 1 , • , (1 ,4 I ":-- ' ' . :' 1.. • . , .... .-, _.-.1 ... ,' :. . „ • • , .1 • i .. ... .. . ' 11 11'1. .-,-1, 1:,--t 1., i ' 111 I`r 1111''' Ill' 1 ' 1 , , li'ill 11111 di dt,lll 1111 ii1g.,... 11.1ili hl 1 lii i' I i ' 'il, :• . i .„.1 ' 11" I.• I r 1 '',l ,ii, ILI ii 11'111. 1111-- ~ -- idi I, .1</p>
