      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-11-15_WidnesExaminer_art0223" n="art0223">
        <p>Now you need An Overcoat!</p>
        <p>With the " bite " of Winter in the air, the immediate necessity for a warm Over- coat has probably forced itself upon your notice. Our huge purchases of OVEH- 00ATS—each variety the latest and best '3l the season's productions—are here awaiting your selection. We welcome a visit from YOU and we are here to take trouble in assisting you to find just THE °VERCOAT you require. Our service ensures you absolute satisfaction and our Prices we KNOW will suit you.</p>
