        <p>will tell you that this excellent preparation is one of the best and most reliable for the relief and cure of those disorders (often formidable) which arise from disturbance of the digestive system. Those who know, will inform you that Beecham's Pills have achieved a remarkable reputation for removing such ailments as constipation, flatulence, biliousness, headache and other symptoms of stomach and liver derangement. Experienced people will strongly advise you to take Beecham's Pills from time to time because in many ways they will benefit you and certainly</p>
