        <p>HERBERT JOHNSON. AUCTIONEER AND VALUER. BEVirSEY CHAMBERS, WARRINGTON. Sales by Auction of Freehold and Leasehold Properties, Building Land, Ground Rents, Farming and Trade Stocks, Household Furni- ture, Stocks, Sharei and Debentures. 'Valuations for Sale, Probate and Mortgage, on reasonable terms.</p>
