        <p>Preliminary Advertisement. SWAN SALE ROOMS, 15, BRIDGE-STREET, WARRINGTON. Clearance Sale. Premises coming down for Corporation Improvements. WEDNESDAY, THURSDAY and FRIDAY, November 26th, 27th and 28th. MR. R. LOWE begs to announce that the London City and Midland Bank having acquired his interest in the lease of the abcme, for their new BA.nk Premises, he will hold a CLEARANCE SALE. of the whole of the contents of the above rooms, entirely without reserve. Catalogues on application. Sale each day at eleven o'clock. MARKET-GATE SALE ROOMS, No. 5, BUTTERMARKET-STREET, WAR- RINGTON. WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 26th, at 3 o'clock. SALE BY AUCTION of ENGLISH-GROWN NURSERY STOCK, CHOICE ROSE TREES, PLANTS, &amp;C. ROBERT LOWE, Auctioneer.</p>
